    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-design-intro",
        "moduleId": "design-intro",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "数据库设计概述",
        "markdown": "教材指出，数据库设计是指对于一个给定的应用环境，构造最优的数据库模式，建立数据库及其应用系统，使之能够有效地存储数据，满足各种用户的应用需求。数据库设计的特点包括：三分技术、七分管理、十二分基础数据；结构设计与行为设计相结合。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000390"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7653,
              "lineEnd": 7656,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "f7b6c6e6bd9f778845f69321d15e19f11d65f3b5b989612cae3fa05ebb844fcf"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000391"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "数据库设计概述"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7657,
              "lineEnd": 7670,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "6badc152f0bd74d4327489152cd4cac4d7041041d2d826c0a6efa07eeb811a95"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-characteristics",
        "moduleId": "design-intro",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "数据库设计的特点",
        "markdown": "教材强调数据库建设的两个基本规律：\n\n1. **三分技术、七分管理、十二分基础数据**：数据库设计不仅涉及技术，更强调数据管理和数据质量。\n2. **结构设计与行为设计相结合**：数据库模式设计（结构设计）必须与应用程序设计（行为设计）同步进行，二者相辅相成。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000392"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "数据库设计的特点"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7671,
              "lineEnd": 7674,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "d75e025bc35996cfa2858cf42656632d9265cbd71cb375569fe43e461b1216c6"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000393"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库设计",
                "数据库建设的基本规律"
              ],
              "lineStart": 7675,
              "lineEnd": 7703,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/2514942b7ae194f276762a903b6242edf708937b1f1c7921a90e842a2d6d16a6.jpg"
              ],
